d | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tb4a,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the MiP Ultra 0.4mm display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MiP Ultra features an ultra-fine pixel pitch of 0.4mm, making it one of the world's finest pitch Mini-in-Package (MiP) LED displays, delivering exceptional image clarity and detail.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What technology does the MiP Ultra 0.4mm use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It utilizes a combination of Active Matrix (AM) drive technology and Micro LED crystals within a Mini-in-Package design to achieve extremely high pixel density and outstanding color performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this display be used in medical environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the MiP Ultra 0.4mm is well-suited for medical applications such as surgical displays due to its high resolution, accurate color reproduction (DCI-P3 95%), and stable brightness of 400 nits.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the MiP Ultra 0.4mm compare to other LED displays in the market?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to conventional LED displays, MiP Ultra offers a much finer pixel pitch of 0.4mm and superior resolution density (3,906 PPI). Its active matrix drive and Micro LED tech deliver higher contrast and refresh rates for clearer, flicker-free images.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MiP Ultra 0.4mm panels are compact and lightweight (4.2 kg per panel) with a slim thickness of 28mm, making them suitable for seamless integration into VR production setups, defense systems, or medical equipment displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a warranty or support package available?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty and after-sales support for the MiP Ultra 0.4mm, ensuring product reliability and effective maintenance. Specific warranty terms can be discussed upon inquiry.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical pricing range for the MiP Ultra 0.4mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing varies based on configuration and order size. Due to its advanced technology and ultra-fine pitch, it is positioned as a premium product. Please contact Brightluxx for customized quotations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What industries benefit the most from the MiP Ultra 0.4mm display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Industries such as VR production, medical imaging, and defense benefit hugely from its unmatched pixel density, excellent color accuracy, and low-latency active matrix drive, enabling precision visuals in critical applications.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"MiP Ultra 0.4mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-mip040\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [