th Micro LED crystals for unprecedented pixel density. Designed for VR production, surgical displays, and defence applications.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the MiP Ultra 0.4mm display?</h3><p>The MiP Ultra features an ultra-fine pixel pitch of 0.4mm, making it one of the world's finest pitch Mini-in-Package (MiP) LED displays, delivering exceptional image clarity and detail.</p><h3>What technology does the MiP Ultra 0.4mm use?</h3><p>It utilizes a combination of Active Matrix (AM) drive technology and Micro LED crystals within a Mini-in-Package design to achieve extremely high pixel density and outstanding color performance.</p><h3>Can this display be used in medical environments?</h3><p>Yes, the MiP Ultra 0.4mm is well-suited for medical applications such as surgical displays due to its high resolution, accurate color reproduction (DCI-P3 95%), and stable brightness of 400 nits.</p><h3>How does the MiP Ultra 0.4mm compare to other LED displays in the market?</h3><p>Compared to conventional LED displays, MiP Ultra offers a much finer pixel pitch of 0.4mm and superior resolution density (3,906 PPI). Its active matrix drive and Micro LED tech deliver higher contrast and refresh rates for clearer, flicker-free images.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"MiP Ultra 0.4mm LED Display - Premium LED Screens Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Dis